  <item>
    <title>回响01｜“父母塑造我肉身，热爱塑造我灵魂”</title>
    <link>https://www.xiaoyuzhoufm.com/episode/677a9e261e823e72d3680ea0</link>
    <guid isPermaLink="false">677a9e261e823e72d3680ea0</guid>
    <pubDate>Sun, 05 Jan 2025 15:05:11 +0000</pubDate>
    <description><![CDATA[<p><strong><span>🎤Show Notes🎤</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART1：我们要从真实世界里吸取生长的能量</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="255">04:15</a> 初印象：在舞台上，她像一条鱼一样自由</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="369">06:09</a> 我们要积极夺回线下生活的权利，珍惜日常的实感</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART2：维持内在秩序，在理想和现实中找到平衡感</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="547">09:07</a> 感到幸福的力量之源：知道有人在不遗余力的爱你</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="729">12:09</a> 音乐陪伴我们经历残酷的生离死别</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="938">15:38</a> 老豆的生活哲学：拥有理想与热爱，并找到与现实的双向平衡</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>PART3：兴趣爱好是你打开世界的一条线索</span></strong></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1307">21:47</a> 音乐是我了解世界的方式</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1424">23:44</a> 理、工发展世界，文、艺改变世界</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1550">25:50</a> 面对意义感缺失时，思考自己是否仅调动了肉体而非灵魂</span></p><span></span><p><span><a class="timestamp" data-timestamp="1675">27:55</a> 专辑推荐：すとう みつる/Mitsuru Sutoh須藤満《6 on 224》</span></p><span></span><p><span>——————————————</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵和泉宏隆/須藤満《Open A Gate》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵林俊杰《裂缝中的阳光》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵郁可唯《路过人间》</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵和泉宏隆/須藤満</span></p><span></span><p><span>🎵和泉宏隆/須藤満《Sunny Side Cruise》</span></p><span></span><p><strong><span>（以上音乐作品按出现顺序排列，谢谢它们带来的美好氛围）</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>——————————————</span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>*老豆的小红书：<a data-url="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/57d0c1fc50c4b4724a37a8d5?xsec_token=ABTFYoj_pKY6gdtfv9fKC-JYhpnZK6huAaGi6pStSNhsY%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search" href="https://www.xiaohongshu.com/user/profile/57d0c1fc50c4b4724a37a8d5?xsec_token=ABTFYoj_pKY6gdtfv9fKC-JYhpnZK6huAaGi6pStSNhsY%3D&amp;xsec_source=pc_search">www.xiaohongshu.com</a></span></strong></p><span></span><p><strong><span>*外公的新年祝福：</span></strong></p><span></span><figure><img src="https://image.xyzcdn.net/FuclAMgTaKMZTVz47domQy4ZRq-B.jpg"></figure>]]></description>
